    "content": "Latest release   {{ site.data.version.release }}     Choose a starting point, add your content and make it your own.    Start your site   Browse 40+ skins     What would you like to build?         {% assign starter_names = 'Personal blog,Technical blog,Portfolio,Project' | split: ',' %}     {% assign starter_paths = 'personal-blog,technical-blog,portfolio,project' | split: ',' %}     {% assign starter_descriptions = 'A journal with recent stories.|Code examples, diagrams and equations.|A collection of projects and the work behind them.|A landing page with source and setup links.' | split: '|' %}     {% for starter in starter_names %}                                {{ starter }}            {{ starter_descriptions[forloop.index0] }}            {% assign starter_url = '/demo/starter-' | append: starter_paths[forloop.index0] %}           Explore example                          {% endfor %}      Each example includes configuration and editable content.     See sites built with Chulapa.        Easy to install   Start with an example or the GitHub template. Install as a remote theme or Ruby gem and follow the publishing guide.        First-class features   Add search, comments, galleries, video and mathematical notation when your site needs them.        Check your published site   Performance depends on your content, images and integrations. See the recorded PageSpeed results and measure your own site.        One theme, a thousand looks   Bootstrap 4 inside! Use Bootstrap theming, any of our 40+ skins or the Chulapa autothemer        Layouts for everything   Blogs, portfolios, projects, archives, image galleries... Use our collection of built-in layouts with lots of additional components      diego.hernangomezherrero@gmail.com",
